9
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:21,970
He can't turn at all

10
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:28,500
The scolded one

11
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:33,610
It will also drift you and you

12
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:40,780
The monkey family is a weak strategist with no abdominal muscles.

13
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:41,780
Come down if you dare

14
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:43,420
Someone will tell you how to be afraid of being confused

15
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:45,260
